{"case_id":"kq-011","case_sha256":"67ebdc986a202cdea2445baf8e497103304acd190d463b3118d6c895a2525f3e","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:01","cdut:chunk:pubelective20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:transfer2026:bs01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:01","cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:pubelective20262027:bs02"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:aaooffices"],"answer":"本科选课与课表问题请咨询教务处教学事务中心，该中心负责本科课表与选课、考试组织、成绩管理及课程重修等事务。科室页面列出地点为办公楼109室，电话为028-84079520；地址和电话仍需现时复核。该来源尚未明确适用哪个校区，建议先按上述信息确认。","behavior":"partial","latency_ms":4935.847699998703,"cost_usd":0.001914126,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-012","case_sha256":"2c887ea7b29170c95bfb4afb902cb443011e5535fadbdc7adf369d78fe111e49","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:02","cdut:candidate-office:06","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:15","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:16"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:candidate-office:06","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:02","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:15","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:16"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:aaooffices"],"answer":"属于教务处学籍管理科的职责。该科负责本科学籍、学历注册、毕业和学位资格审核等事项；资料记载地点为办公楼110室，电话028-84078882，但地点和电话的有效性仍需核对，且来源适用校区尚未确认。","behavior":"partial","latency_ms":4890.272999997251,"cost_usd":0.001947984,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-013","case_sha256":"73c4792d09e4d3ae384ae90497d470e669bcf6a41b65d5c7923fe22b5991fe50","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:05","cdut:candidate-office:03","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:03","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:01","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:02","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:06"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:candidate-office:03","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:05"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:aaooffices"],"answer":"教材征订和发放由教务处教材建设科负责，该科室还负责教材审核、评选和选用。资料记录的地点有办公楼106室和6B107-2，公开电话为028-84078905和028-84079924；这两处地点和电话来自官网页面检索摘要，建议去之前先打电话确认。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":6138.937099996838,"cost_usd":0.002432232,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-014","case_sha256":"2a8013001470c0e1a25715556bcfb1958dea6211a0755e285ad3906692fcd5dd","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:06","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:30","cdut:candidate-office:04","cdut:chunk:xscoffices:02"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:06","cdut:candidate-office:04"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:aaooffices"],"answer":"本科毕业设计和大学生竞赛事务由教务处实践教学科负责，该科室还负责实践教学、实验项目等工作。资料记载地点为办公楼107室，电话028-84078931；地点和电话建议办理前再核对。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":5336.61199999915,"cost_usd":0.00117447,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-015","case_sha256":"58789ffd07880c2dbc1a19ebe49dd0edc5c85c96eb4f14101e2f79df5ee6d620","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:04","cdut:candidate-office:02","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:03","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:04"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:candidate-office:02","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:04"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:aaooffices"],"answer":"由教务处的质量建设与智慧教学科承担，该科负责本科培养方案、专业建设、课程建设与教改等工作。办公楼105室，电话028-84078883；该资料的适用校区尚未确认，去之前建议先电话确认。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":3873.378899996169,"cost_usd":0.00107361,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-016","case_sha256":"2bdee8918a255b71dd05376b5ba301f78404a3af9e8134563d470339a0fa5792","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:24","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs16","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:24","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs16"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:freshman-guide-2026"],"answer":"按2026级本科新生入学须知记载，校医院（成都理工大学医院）被列为“校内非营利性公立医院”，同时也是“大学生医保首诊医院”。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":4956.673000000592,"cost_usd":0.00221319,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-017","case_sha256":"419c32a93e839a0aaca74a52f1d7811e2d78859e93f475ece20fbb90ad9a38b8","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:24","cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs01","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs15","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs15","cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs01","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:24","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:hospoverview","cdut:source:freshman-guide-2026"],"answer":"设有。成都理工大学医院设有口腔科（含口腔诊疗中心）和检验科；口腔科还提供工作日午间及周末延时服务。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":4393.29049999651,"cost_usd":0.0022011,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-018","case_sha256":"c6549e2e0796511fca4c4032f49e89993d5b137df694195cd3f42f921c6a1691","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:expand-canteen:01","cdut:chunk:expand-schedule:02","cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs02","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:14"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs02"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:hospoverview"],"answer":"包含。医院简介的“放射科”项目里明确列有“全身各部位数字化摄影DR检查、CT检查”，另有口腔全景牙摄影DR检查（统计截至2026年2月）。该简介未注明适用校区，具体检查安排可向校医院放射科确认。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":6386.805299996922,"cost_usd":0.001610214,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-019","case_sha256":"04da193cfdc0c731ce4a79b6eccfa8da7dd26b7d32d243edf72a8a69d1dd7c53","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs02","cdut:chunk:cistwork2025:bs01","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs16"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs02"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:hospoverview"],"answer":"校医院与第三方检测机构长期合作，对本院不能自行开展的实验室检测项目，采取标本外送检测的方式处理（信息统计截至2026年2月；该资料来源未注明适用校区）。具体哪些项目可外送、送检周期及费用，建议就诊时向检验科确认。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":4679.400400003942,"cost_usd":0.001260726,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-020","case_sha256":"d00ef754d7eae0858e6e249d2f72f63ebca3f1b109aec000723e7b673464a0b1","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs02","cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs01","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs07","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs15"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs02","cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs01","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs15"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:hospoverview"],"answer":"医院概况中“现有部分检查项目”信息统计截至2026年2月。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":4874.034600004961,"cost_usd":0.002081982,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-031","case_sha256":"1320245b8a5bc5a7b8b5679bdff729af4c060b3c170cb1b9d54b721ed822c109","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:pubelective20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:pubelective20262027:bs02"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:select20262027"],"answer":"按2026—2027学年第一学期选课通知，不能直接选课：须在选课前完成学费缴纳及注册，否则无法选课；缴费问题请咨询财务处。该通知可能已过期，请以最新通知为准；同时，本学期两轮选课已在2026年9月14日18:00结束。通知未注明适用校区。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":7623.827099996561,"cost_usd":0.002310432,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-032","case_sha256":"b1a68277ded2f35aed161eed0f51ee3ef7c40b03f8f8b2db16c4419060f8ecb1","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:15","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:03","cdut:chunk:pubelective20262027:bs01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:03","cdut:chunk:pubelective20262027:bs01"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:select20262027"],"answer":"应关注第2轮选课（非计划课阶段），通知明确该轮为跨年级、跨专业选课。按2026—2027学年第一学期通知，该轮时间为2026年7月9日13:00—9月14日18:00，现已结束；该通知可能已过期，请以最新选课通知为准。选课前还须完成学费缴纳及注册，否则无法选课。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":5628.904299999704,"cost_usd":0.002420454,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-033","case_sha256":"8b90f0c47da6d90f870faf2e381ee3f2af9242ae28c478002ea95e508877e82b","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:04","cdut:chunk:expand-cet:01","cdut:chunk:cet2026h1:bs01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:04"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:select20262027","cdut:source:xjgl2019"],"answer":"不需要。2026-2027学年第一学期选课通知明确，本学期用大学英语四、六级成绩替代大学英语课程的，不需再选相应课程（该通知可能已过期，请以最新通知为准）。替代须符合条件：非英语专业、两年内四级百分制达75分或六级达65分，并持成绩单原件办理。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":4907.807600000524,"cost_usd":0.001738872,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-034","case_sha256":"90d50a17eca9edb647aec9f0feb547532570b3e2f48eb226b2a1c801956a61ac","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:pubelective20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:pubelective20262027:bs02"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:select20262027"],"answer":"不能。按学校2026—2027学年第一学期选课通知，两轮选课均于2026年9月14日18:00截止，选课结束后一律不能补选或退选课程。该通知发布于2026年6月26日，可能已过期，请以教务处最新通知为准。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":4915.547600001446,"cost_usd":0.001671522,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-035","case_sha256":"abefc8df6aa3e46d3506f8939f4509fc11be9aeb1bfb46b641b2b42808e28715","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:01","cdut:candidate-office:05","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:11"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:01"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:select20262027"],"answer":"不允许。教务处明确要求选课仅限在学校教务系统操作，严禁使用第三方抢课软件、脚本外挂；学校会实时监测异常访问，一经查实将取消本次所有选课结果，并按校规处理。该通知为2026年6月26日发布，可能已过期，请以最新通知为准。建议只通过学校教务系统正常选课。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":5645.927499994286,"cost_usd":0.001502436,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-036","case_sha256":"dba729cf02a3cd3366a52891a8196a54b30837351272e30ff59a996b4c1d210d","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:29","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:07","cdut:chunk:wx:fresh2026fee:04"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:wx:fresh2026fee:04","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:29"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:medins2026","cdut:source:wx:fresh2026fee"],"answer":"不能直接套用。医保按属地管理：成都校区学生参加成都市城乡居民基本医疗保险，宜宾校区学生则按宜宾市当地政策执行参保缴费标准和医保待遇，具体可查看宜宾校区官网相关通知。上述通知可能已过期，请以最新通知为准，因此不能用成都校区2026年标准代替宜宾校区的标准。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":6794.486799997685,"cost_usd":0.002249382,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-037","case_sha256":"b876b18a54c3c009989a65627e37d37e55811ba2ee30cd3595ef239fbc680003","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:wx:fee20262027:03","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:wx:fee20262027:03","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:medins2026"],"answer":"不是。助学贷款与大学生医保是两回事：资料明确“办理助学贷款的学生如需参加2026年成都大学生医保，需自行按学校财务处公布的缴费方式完成缴费”，不会自动代缴或免缴。医保本身自愿参保，不参保可不缴。另需注意，2026年集中缴费期已于2025年12月20日左右截止，逾期补办需经学院登记，且自缴费之日起90天后才享受待遇；该须知可能已过期，请以最新通知为准。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":7222.807100006321,"cost_usd":0.002808678,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-038","case_sha256":"c5073194f0bb310c774eb38957d58643bcdfcbc4f135750d4276ecfb3f52afd9","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:official:tuition-2026:insurance-notice","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:official:tuition-2026:insurance-notice"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:medins2026"],"answer":"通知要求先由学院统一收集延迟毕业或休学学生的姓名、学号及缴费金额，再交财务处信息管理中心生成费用信息；宜宾校区按当地政策执行。该通知可能已过期，请以最新通知为准。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":7723.204200003238,"cost_usd":0.003056892,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-039","case_sha256":"47ea4c9ed26aca7bd0b6f81d2c1816e1c4abf95f39e21f044352365b58c5c5c2","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs15"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs15"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:medins2026"],"answer":"不是立即享受。2026年集中参保期外补办的学生，需先经学院收集信息、校医院医保办登记，再按通知缴费；自缴费之日起90天后（不含第90天）才可享受大学生医保待遇。该须知可能已过期，请以最新通知为准；宜宾校区按宜宾市当地政策执行。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":5266.211900001508,"cost_usd":0.002311884,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-040","case_sha256":"31493bad653f296e2b379f5b64bf28cf7860d32b7803e87843f17142e9f6105a","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:09","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:09","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:medins2026"],"answer":"不是强制，也不包含在基本医保内。2026年大学生大病医疗互助补充保险需单独缴费，属于自愿购买险种，只有已购买大学生基本医疗保险的学生才可购买（成都参保标准为基本医保400元/人、大病互助48元/人，自愿）。该资料可能已过期，请以最新通知为准；宜宾校区按当地政策执行。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":5078.420500001812,"cost_usd":0.002251296,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-051","case_sha256":"201bfa5783acdf480932db371fe4549138b93bfced42b1cdd41d1adbb58c30af","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:19","cdut:chunk:expand-card:03","cdut:chunk:expand-card:01","cdut:chunk:expand-card:06"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:expand-card:03","cdut:chunk:expand-card:01","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:19","cdut:chunk:expand-card:06"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:card2024"],"answer":"现有资料没有记载一卡通人工窗口的值班安排，因此无法确认2026年10月是否仍固定每周四值班。已核验的校园卡渠道是“成理校园卡”小程序（充值、挂失解挂）、支付宝“成都理工大学”生活号缴费大厅，以及自助补卡设备（现金充值、挂失），依据2024年8月学生版指南，该指南可能已过期，请以最新通知为准。人工窗口的具体开放时间，建议向网络与信息化处的最新通知核实。","behavior":"partial","latency_ms":6781.159000005573,"cost_usd":0.002524938,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
