{"case_id":"kq-055","case_sha256":"f8b5cde63e4cfa826acaa0d737a6dfd7dd012498baf6b73f17591c659aab7867","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:40","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38","cdut:chunk:identity2021:01","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:35"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:40","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38","cdut:chunk:identity2021:01","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:35"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:identity2021"],"answer":"不能。寒假值班表只能说明假期由谁值班、联系方式有哪些，与统一身份认证系统的升级进度无关；它既不是升级公告，也不能证明当前的升级状态，而且来源属于已过去的寒假。现有资料只覆盖账号激活、安全手机更换和密码找回，没有关于升级状态的说明，建议以网络与信息化处的最新通知为准；如遇账号问题，可咨询028-84079530，拨打前请先核对最新号码。","behavior":"partial","latency_ms":6409.855999998399,"cost_usd":0.002262852,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-056","case_sha256":"ab967cbc972cdce5134b5343e24ce25d277bad8d82209db240c08819ecaecdbd","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:expand-archive:03","cdut:chunk:meeleave2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:official:tuition-2026:insurance-notice","cdut:chunk:lyzn2023:bs03"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:expand-archive:03","cdut:chunk:meeleave2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:official:tuition-2026:insurance-notice","cdut:chunk:lyzn2023:bs03"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:meeleave2026"],"answer":"不能。机电工程学院这份通知由学院在2026年5月26日发布，对象明确为“2026届全体毕业生”，日程安排表也只针对该届，该通知现在已属历史文件（可能已过期，请以最新通知为准）。2027届的离校日期应以学校及机电工程学院针对2027届另行发布的离校日程通知为准；目前无法确认2027届的具体日期。建议临近毕业季关注学院和带班辅导员发布的2027届离校日程。","behavior":"partial","latency_ms":4736.092999999528,"cost_usd":0.00257826,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-057","case_sha256":"c63a415f111b42459f81bec69fb2a56003cbfb29becabc7e2048f6d65374ec3f","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:expand-archive:03","cdut:chunk:meeleave2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1165:guide-body","cdut:chunk:lyzn2023:bs03"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:expand-archive:03","cdut:chunk:meeleave2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1165:guide-body","cdut:chunk:lyzn2023:bs03"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:meeleave2026"],"answer":"没有。机电工程学院2026届毕业生文明离校通知的正文只说明：“根据日程安排做好保障服务、毕业生按日程安排办理各项手续”，并提示“详见附件：机电工程学院2026届毕业生文明离校日程安排表”；正文本身没有逐项列出每项手续的具体日期，具体日期需查看附件日程表。该通知发布于2026年5月26日，可能已过期，请以最新通知为准。","behavior":"partial","latency_ms":5809.492999993381,"cost_usd":0.00278646,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-058","case_sha256":"8cd4dfecb68cdef63c99440ac6279d4d7177223926f41fc4686995c72f923112","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:lyzn2023:bs03","cdut:chunk:meeleave2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:official:tuition-2026:insurance-notice","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs02"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:meeleave2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:lyzn2023:bs03"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:meeleave2026"],"answer":"机电工程学院该通知要求：毕业生如遇离校手续问题，及时与带班辅导员联系。需注意，该通知发布于2026年5月26日，针对2026届毕业生，可能已过期，请以最新通知为准。","behavior":"partial","latency_ms":5557.0021999956225,"cost_usd":0.001867338,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
