{"case_id":"kq-060","case_sha256":"604a00720b28f8dcd61ba4b65ce619d3374d6d9a298196f10d604f3cbad38e93","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:expand-dorm:04","cdut:chunk:meeleave2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:lyfwdorm:bs05","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs08"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:expand-dorm:04","cdut:chunk:meeleave2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:lyfwdorm:bs05","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs08"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:meeleave2026"],"answer":"不能。这份通知由机电工程学院自行制定，明确面向“各科室、系（中心）、2026届全体毕业生”，日程表也是该院专属附件；其他学院没有依据沿用。该通知发布于2026年5月26日，属于历史通知，可能已过期，请以最新通知为准。其他学院毕业生请以本学院发布的离校日程或带班辅导员通知为准。","behavior":"partial","latency_ms":5823.145700000168,"cost_usd":0.002592816,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-071","case_sha256":"02168381d03f18b8ad4786b36c291fd8fe4c73ca2c911cafaef430351feb3e33","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:card2024:01","cdut:chunk:card2024:02","cdut:chunk:expand-card:06","cdut:chunk:expand-card:01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:card2024:01","cdut:chunk:expand-card:01","cdut:chunk:expand-card:06","cdut:chunk:card2024:02"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:card2024"],"answer":"2024年学生版信息化服务指南中的校园卡小程序叫“成理校园卡”微信小程序。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":5416.59339999751,"cost_usd":0.001755258,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-072","case_sha256":"1ffb33e700f4dff8a110b21b8da13d4d0dd49629406f3cef5311dd7a8cf39c89","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:card2024:01","cdut:chunk:card2024:02","cdut:chunk:netfaq2023:01","cdut:chunk:expand-card:01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:card2024:01","cdut:chunk:expand-card:01","cdut:chunk:card2024:02"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:card2024"],"answer":"按《成都理工大学网络与信息化服务指南（学生版）》第四版（2024年8月），绑定“成理校园卡”微信小程序时走统一登录，账号用学工号，密码用砚湖易办密码。该指南对应2024年版本，且未确认适用校区；正式办理前请以现行入口为准。建议先在“成理校园卡”微信小程序进入统一登录，再按提示绑定。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":5607.396200000949,"cost_usd":0.001648914,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-073","case_sha256":"8eb371106536bd5685759925e6cd3b4923423672ef99fcf01233348a2884b171","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:card2024:02","cdut:chunk:expand-card:01","cdut:chunk:card2024:01","cdut:chunk:expand-card:02"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:expand-card:01","cdut:chunk:card2024:02","cdut:chunk:card2024:01","cdut:chunk:expand-card:02"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:card2024"],"answer":"说明了。2024年8月《成都理工大学网络与信息化服务指南（学生版）》第四版写明：①在自助补卡设备上可挂失、解挂，解挂需输入密码和身份证号；②“成理校园卡”微信小程序也提供挂失、解挂功能。该指南还提示校园卡丢失后应立即挂失。这份资料可能已过期，请以最新通知为准；另外，指南未确认适用校区，办理前请复核现行入口。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":5695.301899999322,"cost_usd":0.001876302,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-074","case_sha256":"9b1287f125163a97871803ec480582a7212114a8f12d8e7897829556364be331","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:card2024:03","cdut:chunk:official:graduate-proof-2023:frequency","cdut:chunk:expand-card:01","cdut:chunk:card2024:01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:card2024:03","cdut:chunk:official:graduate-proof-2023:frequency","cdut:chunk:expand-card:01","cdut:chunk:card2024:01"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:card2024"],"answer":"不能。学生版 PDF 摘要只能确认挂失/解挂可在自助补卡设备或“成理校园卡”微信小程序办理，并明确说明它不能证明补卡费用、自助补卡机具体位置或设备实时状态。补卡费用和机器位置需以校园卡中心最新公告为准；挂失章节内容可能已过期，请以最新通知为准，且来源适用校区尚未确认。建议先查看校园卡中心最新公告，再前往办理。","behavior":"partial","latency_ms":6354.296400000749,"cost_usd":0.00248835,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-075","case_sha256":"a41fa775a18d3c7af2995ceda75040ea675a148fc5c143de24433f1f3f2ccc95","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:card2024:02","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:expand-card:02","cdut:chunk:expand-card:03"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:card2024:02","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:expand-card:02","cdut:chunk:expand-card:03"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:card2024","cdut:source:portal-service-guide"],"answer":"不能保证：该指南明确写着“正式办理前应复核现行入口”，它只是2024年版，入口之后可能已有调整。\n\n1. 砚湖易办→“办事指南”：按事项类型、服务对象筛选，在校园卡服务详情页查看当前入口。\n2. “成理校园卡”小程序：2024版指南记录的挂失、解挂、流水查询入口，使用前请以办事指南页面为准。\n\n建议先进入砚湖易办的服务详情页核对入口，再办理。","behavior":"partial","latency_ms":5908.204799998202,"cost_usd":0.002381322,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-076","case_sha256":"deef5fe59602111d83bf6008d99be00c893c161292aa4f8c1166f97812f6fb59","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-5","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:21"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-5","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:21"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:official:portal-1053","cdut:source:portal-service-guide"],"answer":"同一事项的两种写法不一致：流程图按原图保留了“保修”字样，材料名称的记录也照录原图，但事项正文名称是“报修”，官方服务目录里也列作“网络故障报修”。因此，可以解释为流程图用字不统一，“保修”不是另一个事项；办理时按“报修”理解，在“砚湖易办”的“事务中心”找网络与信息化处的“网络故障报修”入口即可（该流程资料适用于本科生、研究生，校区尚未确认）。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":6543.3932000014465,"cost_usd":0.00275664,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-077","case_sha256":"eb2e4adb51dfae678ecab1791b72c0c486fd932775223375529f39b0ee4ca9f9","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:guide-body","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:expand-card:06"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:guide-body","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:official:portal-1053"],"answer":"按流程图，登录砚湖易办后先进入“事务中心”，再选择“网络与信息化处”，然后填写网络故障报修（原图写作“保修”）并提交审批。该流程图适用于本科生、研究生，来源未明确适用校区。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":6631.867500000226,"cost_usd":0.002419752,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-078","case_sha256":"d056b6c5157adb68b86c6101aef614968421afb4d718675bdff4647ac8c0ecb5","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:guide-body","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:official:netcarrier2025:counter-service"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:guide-body","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:official:portal-1053"],"answer":"不是。提交报修只表示申请已发起，之后还需网络与信息化处审核，审批通过后才安排维修，最后由申请人查看审核结果并办结流程。线上入口在“砚湖易办”，进入“事务中心”后选择网络与信息化处。流程图说明适用于本科生、研究生，校区尚未确认。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":5865.200200001709,"cost_usd":0.002402598,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-079","case_sha256":"a067630b238dce0b35e6f994163c89f3b48811e52b305567c6e2704ec7da0d1b","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:guide-body","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:official:netcarrier2025:counter-service"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:guide-body","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:official:portal-1053"],"answer":"不可以。指南明确“办理方式：线上办理、办理途径：线上”，未提供线下提交方式。需登录“砚湖易办”，进入“事务中心”，选择网络与信息化处，填写并提交审批。该事项面向本科生、研究生，适用校区尚未确认。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":5588.781800004654,"cost_usd":0.002094198,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-080","case_sha256":"0f697683656c2faebfa451eb980afb5b1eec71bae231207f4d902a4f384038cb","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:guide-body","cdut:chunk:mee2025grant:bs05","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:guide-body","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:official:portal-1053"],"answer":"网络故障报修申请由**网络与信息化处**受理，并交该处经办人审核。线上办理时，可登录“砚湖易办”，进入“事务中心”，选择网络与信息化处，填写申请表并提交；咨询电话为 028-84079467。图片中的表单文字未能读取，如表格另列“提交部门”，请以表格实际填写栏为准。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":5982.797199998458,"cost_usd":0.00240384,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-091","case_sha256":"847dbee26586e29dd3806efabf7c728fa29295df06c3adeeeee7ad47504ff67b","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs04"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs04"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:loanconfirm2026"],"answer":"不能自行在网页修改。姓名、身份证号、出生日期等身份信息，以及学校名称、学制、入学年份等学籍信息，在国开行毕业确认系统中无法由学生本人修改，需本人联系生源地县级资助管理中心办理更正。该说明来自2026届毕业确认通知，可能已过期，请以最新通知为准。建议先向生源地县级资助管理中心确认需携带的证明材料，再前往办理。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":5086.056200001622,"cost_usd":0.002764842,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-092","case_sha256":"44673ababa98ad3174aabd5fc4f60b04bc730e007e21772f3367c62d7792168a","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs04","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs02"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs04","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs02"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:loanconfirm2026"],"answer":"不够。仅完成毕业确认，只解决了更新贷款信息和衔接还款计划；继续升学的同学还须及时联系生源地资助中心，办理就学信息变更和继续贴息手续。以上依据的是2026届毕业生通知，可能已过期，具体以贷款银行和生源地资助中心最新通知为准；如果办理的是中国银行等国家助学贷款，或是不在上述类型中的银行，可按经办银行指引，在毕业确认或还款确认时填报升学信息，并咨询继续贴息要求。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":8255.042299999332,"cost_usd":0.003679938,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-093","case_sha256":"9d1a6bbd922e016e4a46cde9f3a688f47749667fa1eaf4434f1fbd81df9dc501","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs04"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs04","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs02"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:loanconfirm2026"],"answer":"不是。毕业确认只是核对并确认贷款金额、还款期限等信息，并非要求毕业前还清贷款。按2026届通知，毕业当年9月1日起自行承担利息，毕业后5年为还本宽限期，第6年起归还本息；提前还款需另行申请。该通知可能已过期，请以最新通知为准。","behavior":"partial","latency_ms":6351.8610000028275,"cost_usd":0.002973864,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-094","case_sha256":"222f7d179258be5fdbeb5f587ef34bc823246dda59a0bffd71c1caca5cf78cd1","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:official:tuition-2026:loan-payment","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs02"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs02"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:loanconfirm2026"],"answer":"找到相关来源：2026届毕业生｜国家助学贷款毕业确认，请及时完成！（3/4）、2026届毕业生｜国家助学贷款毕业确认，请及时完成！（1/4）。本次未能整理出可靠答复，可查看下方来源。","behavior":"partial","latency_ms":14060.871500005305,"cost_usd":0.005786292,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-095","case_sha256":"8ee2741511f0614b5bc5a60e2ceec5ff9af54fef53a8a0dbbcfefa4bdfcd8f0e","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:11","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:33","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs03"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:11","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:33","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs03"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:freshman-guide-2026","cdut:source:green-channel-2026","cdut:source:loanconfirm2026"],"answer":"不能全部套用。国开行的在线系统登录、6位回执校验码等流程只适用于国开行贷款学生；如果你的贷款银行不在列举范围内，就必须按经办银行的渠道办理。回执环节可以先在学生工作平台在线填报，但还要把纸质回执单交学院，由学院统一到学校学生资助管理中心盖章（此项依据2026级本科新生须知，仅适用本科生）。毕业确认等环节，请主动联系贷款办理地学生资助管理中心或经办银行，具体渠道和时间以经办银行最新通知为准；该部分依据2026届旧通知，可能已过期。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":7949.670900001365,"cost_usd":0.00333867,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-096","case_sha256":"a7cb7b9ae65f3f95fae975c358f5976e1cc0cf3cce8306bb156d621c6d4fa2fa","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-4","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-3","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:guide-body"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:guide-body","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-3","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-4"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:portal-service-guide","cdut:source:official:portal-06"],"answer":"准备姓名和证件号码，二者须与系统记录一致；安全手机号请填你本人手机号，它是以后找回密码的依据。进入迎新网“在线报到”后选择“激活账号”，绑定安全手机并设置含大小写字母和数字、不少于8位的密码；也可绑定邮箱，至少完成手机或邮箱其中一项。账号问题可咨询网络与信息化处028-84079530。资料标注此说明适用于本科、研究生新生，适用校区尚未确认。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":6493.698699996457,"cost_usd":0.002641866,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-097","case_sha256":"dcd6576a88543abafcb5e6c31ea1dc52392381a63621c413a00471eda9a189bb","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-5","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:guide-body","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:08"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-5","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:guide-body","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:08"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:official:portal-06"],"answer":"来源的条件表述存在差异，当前不能据此保证具体边界。请以当前官方办理页面的校验或主管部门确认为准。","behavior":"partial","latency_ms":4251.935299995239,"cost_usd":0.000610122,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-098","case_sha256":"de0abd16dc37a673e1b3e78ac2c5846fd3e1366abc98a4c44aaafd30931f4a7b","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-3","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-5","cdut:chunk:wx:fresh2026fee:01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-3","cdut:chunk:wx:fresh2026fee:01","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-5"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:portal-service-guide","cdut:source:official:portal-06"],"answer":"不是直接成功。新生在迎新网“在线报到”选择“激活账号”，输入姓名和证件号码并核验一致后，还需进入绑定安全手机/邮箱页面，获取验证码并设置密码，页面显示激活成功后才能用账号登录。密码需包含大小写字母和数字、不少于8位；图示标为8—20位，实际以当前激活页面的校验为准。现有说明至少适用于本科生（另有图示写本科生、研究生），适用校区尚未确认。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":11253.817299999355,"cost_usd":0.003794934,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-099","case_sha256":"d30fe2afce92dadc9e0c7c2e9a7e263aa5eaf28d50bc30c8e2f9dcbbb4ddd786","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-4","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:44","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:guide-body","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:guide-body","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-4","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:44"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:official:portal-06","cdut:source:portal-service-guide"],"answer":"输入收到的验证码后点击“下一步”，接着设置密码：密码必须同时包含大写字母、小写字母和数字，长度不少于8位。设置完成后，页面显示激活成功，即可用该账号访问学校系统。账号问题可咨询网络与信息化处028-84079530。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":8446.679100001347,"cost_usd":0.002915778,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-100","case_sha256":"797e9c6fd8bc31b07ac5874057ea3ed1f3604b0086343ffddc0ffeed09240309","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-5","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-6","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:guide-body"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-5","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-6","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:guide-body"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:evidence:bsdt-06","cdut:source:official:portal-06"],"answer":"不表示。流程图第6步的原文只有“恭喜您！您的账号已经激活成功！返回登录页面”，因此这只说明账号激活成功，你可以用该账号访问学校系统，并不等于迎新报到、缴费、注册等其他业务也已办完。资料没有收录激活后的办理流程，所以其他业务的办理状态无法据此确认；该激活流程仅适用于新生（本科生、研究生）。激活后请回到迎新网“在线报到”查看各项业务是否还需单独办理。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":6737.378599995282,"cost_usd":0.003494148,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-111","case_sha256":"f017ccc077b5363da600321596b935512aef9c773d38c5ad58695cd9f3615ea5","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1042:guide-body","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1042:flow-image","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:43","cdut:chunk:psych2026:bs01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1042:guide-body","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1042:flow-image","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:43","cdut:chunk:psych2026:bs01"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:official:portal-1042","cdut:source:psych-fall-2026"],"answer":"不能。那份指南是静态办理说明，只讲预约方式、入口和联系方式（心理健康教育中心，电话028-84075525），不含实时余号，也未标注发布日期和适用校区，无法证明本周还有哪些空档。本周具体可约时段要在校园网内登录“砚湖易办”→事务中心→“心理咨询预约”实时查看，或直接致电028-84075525、问询QQ 1984818352；2026年秋季学期咨询时间为周一至周五9:00—18:00。","behavior":"partial","latency_ms":5381.128299995908,"cost_usd":0.002594064,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-112","case_sha256":"051dd4ff9d1cbccd23000a658d3b7c8bd5cb182a497a2e65311b566d9046189f","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1042:guide-body","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1042:flow-image","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:43","cdut:chunk:psych2026:bs01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1042:guide-body","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1042:flow-image","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:43","cdut:chunk:psych2026:bs01"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:evidence:bsdt-1042","cdut:source:official:portal-1042","cdut:source:psych-fall-2026"],"answer":"不能。「心理咨询预约」事项详情中的“办理流程”只写着“1.如下：”，没有实际步骤，因此不能当作完整的咨询流程；系统也未生成可执行的步骤清单，只把它标注为办理指南。流程内容实际在官方流程图中：电脑登录“砚湖易办”，进入“事务中心”，填写“心理咨询预约”，预约成功后到心理健康教育中心线下咨询；手机端则从官方企业号进入“学生事务板块”。2026年秋季学期还可在校园网内线上预约或现场预约，成都校区在芙蓉餐厅三楼，宜宾校区在二期食堂三楼（适用本科生、研究生，校区以实际核对为准）。","behavior":"partial","latency_ms":6986.440200002107,"cost_usd":0.003246306,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
